{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-04-13 09:02:00', 'title': 'NIPSCO AND CAPITAL DYNAMICS SIGN 200-MEGAWATT SOLAR ENERGY BUILD TRANSFER AGREEMENT', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., APRIL 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORTHERN INDIANA PUBLIC SERVICE COMPANY, LLC (NIPSCO), A SUBSIDIARY OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI), AND THE CLEAN ENERGY INFRASTRUCTURE (CEI) BUSINESS OF CAPITAL DYNAMICS, AN INDEPENDENT GLOBAL PRIVATE ASSET MANAGEMENT FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE SIGNED A BUILD TRANSFER AGREEMENT (BTA) TO BRING 200 MEGAWATTS (MW) OF SOLAR ENERGY TO INDIANA WITH THE ELLIOT SOLAR PROJECT.'}